    "text": "Further evidence led by the prosecution in this case clearly indicate that she had left her house because of the harassment meted out to her by the accused-appellant. She has never stated to court that it was because of the sexual harassment by the accused-appellant. The prosecutrix had stated that the accused-appellant questioned her about a person called",
