    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 6,
    "bbox": [
      62.81,
      129.2,
      537.01,
      188.32
    ],
    "text": "If Where an accused is charged with rape, corroboration of the story of the prosecutrix must come from some independent quarter and not from the prosecutrix herself. A complaint made by the prosecutrix to the",
    "fonts": [
      "Helvetica",
      "Helvetica-Oblique"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      6.92745304107666,
      13.580537796020508,
      13.814929008483887,
