      14.334512710571289,
      14.338672637939453,
      14.475919723510742,
      14.4979248046875
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 6,
    "bbox": [
      62.79,
      188.5,
      535.52,
      247.37
    ],
    "text": "police in which she implicated the accused cannot be regarded as corroboration of her evidence. The crucial issue that arose for determination by the learned trial Judge",
    "fonts": [
      "Helvetica"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.328614234924316,
      14.103421211242676,
      14.120124816894531,
