    "bbox": [
      63.05,
      247.29,
      537.57,
      345.28
    ],
    "text": "in the instant case was whether this girl had been subjected to sexual intercourse between the period commencing from pt August to 3pt August 2001 as alleged by the prosecution. According to the evidence given by her, the alleged incident took place somewhere in June 2001 or thereafter. To the police she has stated August 2001. The history given",
    "fonts": [
      "Helvetica",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.456114768981934,
      13.890067100524902,
      13.964496612548828,
      14.040555000305176,
      14.077169418334961,
      14.199999809265137,
