    "text": "16.08.1998 or a date prior to that date. Neither the State Counsel nor the trial Judge had invited her to elucidate her opinion any further or elaborate the grounds upon which the opinion was based. (2)The crucial issue was whether the prosecutrix had been in fact",
    "fonts": [
      "Helvetica"
    ],
