      58.73,
      89.45,
      532.21,
      246.07
    ],
    "text": "error of law which is sufficient to vitiate the conviction. I hold that the evidence of the prosecutrix is not credible. And it is not safe to act on her evidence. For the above reasons, I hold that the evidence of the prosecutrix is not reliable and could be believed. I, therefore, hold that it is unsafe to allow the conviction to stand. I. therefore, set aside the conviction and the sentence and acquit the accused. Appeal allowed.",
